                <pb facs="0912" n="824" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg824"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Therapia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-08-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 4,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Regret to report that the promised reply to the President’s message has not been
                    received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leishman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
